:: StoryTitle
Zombie Chase

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "637D0CD9-6182-4ACE-9AF0-B6FB94AB090A",
  "format": "SugarCube",
  "format-version": "2.37.3",
  "start": "Home",
  "zoom": 1
}

:: StoryInit {"position": "100,100", "size": "100,100"}
:: Home
<div class="phone">Zombies are Stopped.<button id="muteButton" class="muteButton settings" data-passage="Audio Control">⚙️</button>
<img src="../../img/exercise/stillFrame.png">
  <div class="mainTab"> <div class="progress-container" id="bar"><div class="progress-fill totalBarFill"> </div></div>\
    <span id="zombieDist"></span>
      <div class="levelContainer">
        <div class="levelList"> Begin the Chase:\
          <<button "Easy" "Chase">><<run setup.setMode('easy')>><</button>>
          <<button "Medium" "Chase">><<run setup.setMode('med')>><</button>>
          <<button "Hard" "Chase">><<run setup.setMode('hard')>><</button>>
          /* <<button "Impossible" "Chase">><<run setup.setMode('impossible')>><</button>> */\
        </div>
      </div>
      <<done>><<run setup.zombieDistText = document.getElementById("zombieDist"); >><</done>>
      <<done>><<run setup.sendFlutterMessage("GET_ZOMBIE_DISTANCE"); >><</done>>
      
  </div>
</div>

:: Chase
<div class="phone">Step Power: <span id="multi"></span> <button id="muteButton" class="muteButton" onclick="SugarCube.setup.muteAudio()">🔊</button>
  <video autoplay loop muted playsinline class="video">\
  /*IMPORTANT: This currently has not been tested on an Iphone, safari does not support webm.\
  To fix, use an iMac to produce an HEVC (with alpha) file and add to the sources here.*/\
    <source src="../../img/exercise/zombies.webm" type="video/mp4">\
    Your browser does not support the video tag.\
  </video>\
  <div class="progress-container totalBar" id="bar"><div class="progress-fill totalBarFill"> </div></div>\
  <span id="zombieDist"></span>
  <span id="yourDist">You've Walked <<=setup.totalWalked>> Steps!</span>
  <span id="zombieCnt"></span><div class="mainTab"> /*<<button "Run!" >> <<run setup.incZombieDist(1)>><</button>>*/\
  <div class="extras" id="extras">Extras</div>\
  <button data-passage="Home" class="return" onclick="SugarCube.setup.stopChase()">Return</button>
  <<done>><<run setup.startChase() >><</done>>
  <<done>><<run setup.updateTotalDistance() >><</done>>
  <<done>><<run setup.DEVplayInComputer() >><</done>>

  </div>
</div>

:: Audio Control
<div class="phone">\
<h2>🔊 Audio Settings</h2>\
    <div class="audio-control">\
        <div class="audio-label">\
            <span class="audio-icon">🎵</span><label for="music-volume">Music</label>
        </div>
        <input
            type="range"
            id="music-volume"
            min="0"
            max="100"
            value="75"
        />
    </div>
    <div class="audio-control">\
        <div class="audio-label">\
            <span class="audio-icon">💥</span><label for="sfx-volume">Sound Effects</label>
        </div>
        <input
            type="range"
            id="sfx-volume"
            min="0"
            max="100"
            value="75"
        />
    </div>
<button data-passage="Home" class="goAgainButton">Home</button>
</div>

:: You Win
<div class="phone">Congratulations!
<img src="../../img/exercise/winZombie.webp" class="endImg">
Feel free to play again at a different difficulty, and keep on going!
You travelled: <<=setup.actualDistance>> steps
<div id="blankSpace"></div>

<button data-passage="Home" class="goAgainButton" onclick="SugarCube.setup.reset()">Go Again!</button>
</div>
:: You Lose
<div class="phone">The Zombies caught you...
<img src="../../img/exercise/DefeatZombie.webp" class="endImg">
But don't worry! You can always try again.
You travelled: <<=setup.actualDistance>> steps

<button data-passage="Home" class="goAgainButton" onclick="SugarCube.setup.reset()">Go Again!</button>
</div>